WEBVTT

00:01:41.460 --> 00:01:44.290
Master Arata, are you all right?

00:01:45.290 --> 00:01:46.750
Tsukuyo just suddenly...

00:01:47.090 --> 00:01:49.320
What's going on? 
Since yesterday, it's...

00:01:51.540 --> 00:01:52.580
This is...

00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:54.400
What's wrong?

00:02:09.390 --> 00:02:10.440
Who are you?!

00:02:11.010 --> 00:02:12.780
This presence... Is he a Sho?

00:02:13.750 --> 00:02:14.950
Master Arata?

00:02:15.700 --> 00:02:17.800
Why are you here,

00:02:18.960 --> 00:02:20.160
Kadowaki?

00:02:21.510 --> 00:02:27.160
Demonization

00:02:27.400 --> 00:02:28.920
I found you.

00:02:38.640 --> 00:02:39.800
A Hayagami?

00:02:40.270 --> 00:02:41.860
Appear.

00:02:43.470 --> 00:02:45.770
Kill him, Orochi!

00:02:47.710 --> 00:02:48.890
Appear!

00:02:57.910 --> 00:02:58.740
Orochi...

00:02:59.720 --> 00:03:01.130
I see.

00:03:01.130 --> 00:03:04.630
So that's the Hayagami that'll 
rule this world, or whatever?

00:03:04.630 --> 00:03:06.540
I hear it's really strong.

00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:09.920
Master Arata, who is he?

00:03:10.620 --> 00:03:12.450
Kadowaki...

00:03:12.450 --> 00:03:14.670
Why are you in this world?!

00:03:15.710 --> 00:03:17.170
In this world?

00:03:17.170 --> 00:03:20.910
Why? That's what I want to ask you!

00:03:20.910 --> 00:03:23.930
You ran off to some weird world, 
leaving that guy in your place...

00:03:24.350 --> 00:03:27.260
Were you that scared of me? Huh?!

00:03:28.770 --> 00:03:30.730
I'm sure that's it.

00:03:30.730 --> 00:03:34.700
You've been a worthless coward 
ever since middle school.

00:03:34.700 --> 00:03:37.170
You're absolutely pathetic.

00:03:37.170 --> 00:03:38.870
No matter how much I messed with you,

00:03:38.870 --> 00:03:40.200
you just took it without a word!

00:03:40.200 --> 00:03:42.450
In that world, you were 
just a spineless wimp

00:03:42.450 --> 00:03:43.980
who did nothing but run away!

00:03:43.980 --> 00:03:47.470
And in this world, you're the 
Sho of the strongest Hayagami?

00:03:47.470 --> 00:03:49.030
You want to become king?

00:03:49.030 --> 00:03:51.210
Give me a break, you scum!

00:03:52.900 --> 00:03:53.960
Stop it...

00:03:53.960 --> 00:03:56.360
It's all your fault!

00:03:56.360 --> 00:03:58.800
Trying to run away from me, are you?

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:00.580
I'll never let you!

00:04:00.580 --> 00:04:05.300
Scum like you should spend your 
life groveling at my feet!

00:04:06.770 --> 00:04:08.100
Shut up.

00:04:12.010 --> 00:04:13.420
Shut up.

00:04:16.830 --> 00:04:17.820
This is...

00:04:18.510 --> 00:04:21.240
It can't be. Tsukuyo has demonized?

00:04:22.050 --> 00:04:23.230
No...

00:04:23.230 --> 00:04:24.160
Arata...

00:04:58.530 --> 00:04:59.870
Kadowaki...

00:05:00.470 --> 00:05:03.150
Do you know what I've been 
through because of you?

00:05:04.160 --> 00:05:06.100
Do you know what I've felt?!

00:05:07.350 --> 00:05:11.620
You're the scum!

00:05:20.390 --> 00:05:21.400
No!

00:05:21.400 --> 00:05:24.170
If he's not stopped, Tsukuyo will 
turn completely into an Onigami!

00:05:28.360 --> 00:05:29.720
Don't, Master Arata!

00:05:30.420 --> 00:05:33.460
Don't become a demon! Come back!

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:35.520
Kotoha-chan!

00:05:37.010 --> 00:05:40.030
Master Arata won't become a demon.

00:05:40.650 --> 00:05:44.160
Master Arata is kinder than anyone!

00:05:47.940 --> 00:05:51.090
I believe in you!

00:05:58.710 --> 00:06:00.040
Kotoha-chan!

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:04.200
What? You're done already, Hinohara?!

00:06:04.200 --> 00:06:05.110
That is enough.

00:06:06.040 --> 00:06:08.670
Withdraw for now, Kadowaki the Sho.

00:06:09.350 --> 00:06:11.350
Something we failed to 
foresee has occurred.

00:06:11.940 --> 00:06:14.220
We never thought Tsukuyo 
would demonize.

00:06:14.220 --> 00:06:18.060
We need to awaken Orochi completely.

00:06:19.620 --> 00:06:21.710
Awaken Orochi completely?

00:06:35.930 --> 00:06:37.450
That's the Six Shos' airship.

00:06:37.800 --> 00:06:39.420
Kotoha-chan! Hey!

00:06:39.900 --> 00:06:41.260
What happened?

00:06:51.210 --> 00:06:53.090
Lord Kannagi, give that back!

00:06:53.090 --> 00:06:54.640
That's Arata's Hayagami!

00:06:55.020 --> 00:06:57.240
Arata is the one who let it go.

00:06:59.830 --> 00:07:00.960
Wait!

00:07:04.750 --> 00:07:06.080
Kadowaki...

00:07:09.500 --> 00:07:10.600
Kotoha...

00:07:11.220 --> 00:07:12.130
Kotoha!

00:07:14.920 --> 00:07:18.330
Master Arata... Thank goodness.

00:07:27.260 --> 00:07:29.660
I'm sorry. It was my fault.

00:07:32.400 --> 00:07:34.850
Who was that person?

00:07:37.460 --> 00:07:40.520
What did you mean by "in this world"?

00:07:49.920 --> 00:07:50.710
Kotoha?

00:07:57.800 --> 00:07:58.740
You're not him.

00:07:59.990 --> 00:08:01.330
You're really not him.

00:08:01.840 --> 00:08:05.480
The real Master Arata wouldn't 
react to me this way.

00:08:06.500 --> 00:08:08.500
Who are you?

00:08:11.790 --> 00:08:13.530
Look me in the eyes.

00:08:14.310 --> 00:08:16.160
Who are you?

00:08:18.710 --> 00:08:20.780
I'm not him.

00:08:22.380 --> 00:08:28.180
To you, I guess look like your 
childhood friend, Arata.

00:08:28.840 --> 00:08:30.600
But I came from another world,

00:08:30.600 --> 00:08:33.750
and switched places with 
him in the Kando Forest.

00:08:35.330 --> 00:08:36.820
You're someone else?

00:08:37.880 --> 00:08:39.480
I didn't mean to deceive you.

00:08:40.030 --> 00:08:43.110
But I was mistaken for the Arata of 
this world as soon as I got here,

00:08:43.980 --> 00:08:45.910
and there was no time

00:08:45.910 --> 00:08:47.690
to straighten it out before 
I became Tsukuyo's Sho.

00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:50.390
And you know the rest.

00:08:52.000 --> 00:08:54.770
I'm really sorry.

00:08:56.800 --> 00:08:59.410
You're not Master Arata.

00:09:00.110 --> 00:09:03.030
He's in my world, doing just fine.

00:09:03.810 --> 00:09:06.210
Arata is well.

00:09:06.850 --> 00:09:07.800
Why?

00:09:08.850 --> 00:09:10.310
Why did you demonize?

00:09:11.300 --> 00:09:12.550
Was it his fault?

00:09:14.300 --> 00:09:19.410
Kadowaki hates me.

00:09:34.420 --> 00:09:36.130
Who are you?

00:09:37.690 --> 00:09:40.120
My name is Miyabi.

00:09:40.120 --> 00:09:42.800
I will serve as your 
handmaiden starting today.

00:09:42.800 --> 00:09:44.850
Oh, good morning!

00:09:46.140 --> 00:09:47.120
Get out.

00:09:47.120 --> 00:09:47.830
Pardon?

00:09:48.270 --> 00:09:49.230
Get out!

00:09:49.620 --> 00:09:54.440
Of course. Just let me know 
if there's anything you need.

00:09:58.780 --> 00:10:01.410
Please excuse me.

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:05.180
What's with her?

00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:07.780
"Good morning"?

00:10:08.290 --> 00:10:09.480
It's still night.

00:10:19.190 --> 00:10:21.770
He finally took me seriously.

00:10:22.590 --> 00:10:25.580
If he hadn't, we could 
never have a real battle.

00:10:26.530 --> 00:10:29.040
You won't get away, Hinohara.

00:10:31.040 --> 00:10:32.110
Bullying?

00:10:32.740 --> 00:10:36.280
Every day, Kadowaki and his buddies

00:10:36.280 --> 00:10:38.660
pushed me around with no resistance.

00:10:40.620 --> 00:10:45.000
At school, I was forced 
to submit all the time.

00:10:48.180 --> 00:10:51.040
I know power is necessary sometimes.

00:10:51.660 --> 00:10:55.420
But only people who have 
felt that pain, fear,

00:10:55.420 --> 00:10:57.660
and misery can understand.

00:10:58.540 --> 00:11:01.060
So I decided to never possess 
that kind of power.

00:11:01.410 --> 00:11:04.050
Never use power against anyone else.

00:11:04.730 --> 00:11:07.850
But that power was inside me, too.

00:11:08.430 --> 00:11:11.000
The same power that's inside 
Kadowaki and Akachi...

00:11:12.090 --> 00:11:15.310
I might become a demon again.

00:11:15.850 --> 00:11:17.410
And if I do, I might...

00:11:20.370 --> 00:11:21.240
Sorry.

00:11:22.620 --> 00:11:25.170
Saying all that doesn't help, does it?

00:11:25.480 --> 00:11:26.450
What is...

00:11:28.030 --> 00:11:30.810
What is your real name?

00:11:33.560 --> 00:11:35.200
Hinohara Arata.

00:11:35.660 --> 00:11:38.320
We have the same name.

00:11:50.110 --> 00:11:51.940
I have to get Tsukuyo back, fast!

00:11:52.940 --> 00:11:54.850
This is Lord Yorunami's domain.

00:11:55.410 --> 00:11:58.310
And this rain is Lord Yorunami's Kamui.

00:11:58.310 --> 00:11:59.730
If we come under attack now...

00:12:19.620 --> 00:12:21.040
Found him!

00:12:24.170 --> 00:12:25.250
I'm going back.

00:12:30.890 --> 00:12:33.860
Going back? Lord Kannagi?

00:12:41.940 --> 00:12:43.700
You look pathetic.

00:12:44.040 --> 00:12:45.990
There's no sign of the man 
you became just before.

00:12:48.430 --> 00:12:51.120
What's wrong? Aren't you 
going to take it back?

00:12:58.380 --> 00:12:59.420
Lord Kannagi!

00:12:59.880 --> 00:13:02.570
Is that all there is to you?

00:13:02.570 --> 00:13:04.290
Weren't you going to change the world?

00:13:04.600 --> 00:13:05.500
If that's your decision,

00:13:05.500 --> 00:13:08.350
then see it through, 
no matter what happens!

00:13:08.750 --> 00:13:11.560
Take Tsukuyo in your hand again, Arata!

00:13:12.890 --> 00:13:15.810
Didn't you want Tsukuyo for yourself?

00:13:17.980 --> 00:13:20.770
It was my first time holding 
someone else's Hayagami.

00:13:21.760 --> 00:13:23.500
Your Tsukuyo is heavy.

00:13:24.740 --> 00:13:27.310
Heavy with the weight of your 
mission and your responsibility.

00:13:27.970 --> 00:13:29.800
Who else can wield that?

00:14:00.580 --> 00:14:04.400
You really piss me off, 
getting stronger all the time.

00:14:07.450 --> 00:14:08.270
Here I come!

00:14:08.270 --> 00:14:08.970
Wait.

00:14:09.980 --> 00:14:11.500
I'll spar with you.

00:14:41.030 --> 00:14:43.430
That man who broke Orochi's seal

00:14:44.210 --> 00:14:45.900
was one of the Six Sho.

00:14:46.190 --> 00:14:47.420
Six Sho?

00:14:48.310 --> 00:14:49.030
<i>Does that mean</i>

00:14:49.360 --> 00:14:53.120
<i>Kadowaki took the place of one 
of the Six Sho in this world?</i>

00:14:56.210 --> 00:14:59.310
I don't know what happened 
between the two of you,

00:14:59.870 --> 00:15:02.460
but he will come after you again.

00:15:03.590 --> 00:15:06.510
What will you do when he does?

00:15:16.220 --> 00:15:19.000
Lord Kannagi! What are you doing?!

00:15:19.570 --> 00:15:22.060
It's useless to you right now.

00:15:22.570 --> 00:15:24.250
You are hesitant.

00:15:24.680 --> 00:15:27.070
You fear you will demonize again.

00:15:27.070 --> 00:15:28.070
Am I wrong?

00:15:29.470 --> 00:15:32.250
Can someone like you change this world?

00:15:33.040 --> 00:15:35.780
You are not worth 
believing in right now.

00:15:37.290 --> 00:15:40.080
Find Tsukuyo before sundown.

00:15:40.910 --> 00:15:43.790
If you fail, leave us.

00:15:47.890 --> 00:15:50.470
There's no way you can succeed!

00:15:51.320 --> 00:15:52.470
What are you gonna do, Arata?

00:16:02.220 --> 00:16:03.710
Hey! Arata!

00:16:04.290 --> 00:16:06.190
Are you serious?! Hey!

00:16:39.930 --> 00:16:42.030
<i>What am I doing?</i>

00:16:43.320 --> 00:16:45.980
<i>Why am I running down a path like this?</i>

00:17:01.770 --> 00:17:05.080
<i>Can I really take Tsukuyo back?</i>

00:17:05.820 --> 00:17:08.460
<i>I have the same demon 
power that I condemned</i>

00:17:08.460 --> 00:17:09.930
<i>in Kadowaki and Akachi.</i>

00:17:10.630 --> 00:17:14.730
<i>Can someone like me really 
keep moving forward?</i>

00:17:14.730 --> 00:17:15.650
<i>Hinohara!</i>

00:17:18.070 --> 00:17:20.800
<i>Hinohara, run with all your strength.</i>

00:17:24.840 --> 00:17:26.270
<i>Kadowaki...</i>

00:17:27.630 --> 00:17:29.190
<i>You're Hinohara, right?</i>

00:17:29.190 --> 00:17:31.820
<i>You've got really nice form.</i>

00:17:31.820 --> 00:17:34.820
<i>All right! We're in the same class!</i>

00:17:35.120 --> 00:17:38.700
<i>I'm gonna beat your time 
one of these days!</i>

00:17:39.850 --> 00:17:43.960
<i>You know, it feels great 
running next to you.</i>

00:17:44.390 --> 00:17:46.830
<i>When I run with you, 
I feel like the wind.</i>

00:17:47.640 --> 00:17:50.520
<i>So keep running with your eyes forward.</i>

00:17:51.700 --> 00:17:53.750
<i>I'll keep running beside you.</i>

00:17:54.550 --> 00:17:57.170
<i>Run with all your strength, Hinohara.</i>

00:18:13.380 --> 00:18:14.490
We...

00:18:18.680 --> 00:18:21.050
We were friends, weren't we?

00:18:23.710 --> 00:18:24.590
Kadowaki...

00:18:29.910 --> 00:18:33.090
Hinohara? Is he a Sho?

00:18:33.440 --> 00:18:35.170
He's spineless scum.

00:18:35.830 --> 00:18:38.240
One day, I will crush him.

00:18:39.020 --> 00:18:41.280
He gets on my nerves.

00:18:41.820 --> 00:18:44.230
I wish he'd just disappear.

00:18:45.970 --> 00:18:48.980
You really like 
Hinohara-san, don't you?

00:18:48.980 --> 00:18:50.040
What?

00:18:50.380 --> 00:18:52.890
If you hated him, 
you could just ignore him.

00:18:52.890 --> 00:18:54.480
You can't help thinking about him.

00:18:55.690 --> 00:18:58.490
That's the other side 
of liking someone.

00:18:58.770 --> 00:19:02.340
In truth, you want to be 
friends with Hinohara-san.

00:19:03.010 --> 00:19:05.290
Don't talk like you know anything!

00:19:05.760 --> 00:19:08.350
What do you know about 
me and Hinohara?!

00:19:09.360 --> 00:19:11.920
It was his fault!

00:19:12.840 --> 00:19:14.220
I was in a slump.

00:19:14.220 --> 00:19:17.210
My time just barely qualified 
me for the tournament.

00:19:18.030 --> 00:19:22.310
So I asked to run by his side.

00:19:23.540 --> 00:19:26.470
He was the only one whose 
skill I acknowledged.

00:19:28.380 --> 00:19:30.970
We'd race with all our 
strength, and if I lost,

00:19:30.970 --> 00:19:32.150
I'd still get what I wanted.

00:19:32.960 --> 00:19:34.460
If it was Hinohara...

00:19:35.180 --> 00:19:36.290
But he...

00:19:44.480 --> 00:19:45.660
<i>Hinohara!</i>

00:19:46.030 --> 00:19:48.180
<i>Did you reduce your speed on purpose?!</i>

00:19:48.180 --> 00:19:49.730
<i>Are you pitying me?!</i>

00:19:49.730 --> 00:19:50.580
<i>What?</i>

00:19:51.890 --> 00:19:52.960
<i>Don't screw with me!</i>

00:19:53.880 --> 00:19:55.250
<i>Don't screw with me!</i>

00:19:55.670 --> 00:19:56.970
<i>Don't screw with me!</i>

00:19:58.750 --> 00:20:00.980
<i>Don't you make fun of me!</i>

00:20:04.890 --> 00:20:07.780
I was the only one who 
thought we were friends.

00:20:08.570 --> 00:20:12.330
That's why I'll crush him.

00:20:16.960 --> 00:20:18.000
Arata!

00:20:27.950 --> 00:20:30.420
What's the deal? You had us worried!

00:20:37.720 --> 00:20:40.050
Fine. I'll believe in you.

00:20:52.520 --> 00:20:56.170
Kadowaki got me past my hesitation.

00:20:57.020 --> 00:20:59.650
I want to move forward.

00:21:01.750 --> 00:21:05.320
I'm still not confident, but I'll try.

00:21:06.030 --> 00:21:08.360
I'll change Kadowaki's heart.

00:21:09.360 --> 00:21:13.760
And I swear I won't become a demon.

00:21:19.010 --> 00:21:19.800
Kotoha?

00:21:20.500 --> 00:21:22.240
Yes. I believe in you.

00:21:22.560 --> 00:21:26.770
You are strong. I'll be watching you.

00:21:35.040 --> 00:21:37.590
Hey! Damn you, Arata!

00:21:39.870 --> 00:21:42.480
Kotoha, thank you.

00:21:46.020 --> 00:21:49.200
You'll be fine, Arata.

00:21:51.620 --> 00:21:55.160
I thought his kindness was all 
that boy had going for him.

00:21:55.650 --> 00:21:59.410
But he has the power of darkness, 
and the heart to calm it.

00:22:00.550 --> 00:22:01.880
Arata the Sho...

00:22:02.640 --> 00:22:03.730
Maybe you are the one

00:22:04.360 --> 00:22:07.500
who can return Lord Yorunami to what he was.

00:23:40.600 --> 00:23:42.310
Who do you think you are?

00:23:42.310 --> 00:23:45.530
I'm just a stingy control 
freak, Lord Kannagi.

00:23:45.530 --> 00:23:47.660
Destroy me with your Kamui!

00:23:47.660 --> 00:23:50.030
You cannot defeat Arata.

00:23:50.440 --> 00:23:54.990
I want to win! I want to beat him!

00:23:51.030 --> 00:23:54.660
Admiration
